// Library.CEmitTags.ailang
// Instruction tagging and post-pass peephole optimization.
// Design and correctness invariants: see EMIT_TAG_DESIGN.md
// Location: Librarys/Compiler/CodeEmit/Library.CEmitTags.ailang
